WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:05.280
Hi everybody. My name is Laura Pearl and I&nbsp;
am the head of safeguarding at Newton Abbott&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:09.480
College. Newton Abbott College have worked&nbsp;
incredibly closely with the community safety&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:14.160
partnership for a number of years, on a number&nbsp;
of projects, however most recently we have been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.780
working with them to address the anti-social&nbsp;
behaviour within town and the surrounding areas.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:24.720
Working closely has meant that we have been&nbsp;
able to quickly identify individuals and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.620
also groups of students that have caused&nbsp;
disruption in town and we have been able&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:33.360
to name those young people, address their&nbsp;
behaviours, and also work with them within&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.540
school and work with their parents as&nbsp;
well to try and disrupt behaviours.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:42.420
The work that we have continued to do has had a&nbsp;
real positive effect on students walking to and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:47.280
from school, in regards to them feeling safe&nbsp;
and I would encourage everybody to continue&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:52.020
to report anti-social behaviour that they see in&nbsp;
order to continue the work that we've been doing

